1
00:01:37,970 --> 00:01:43,050
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,090 --> 00:01:43,670
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,670 --> 00:01:45,940
[Episode 14]

4
00:01:57,789 --> 00:02:01,260
[Pure as Sea Water]

5
00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:18,070
[Integrity, Impartiality,
Prudence, and Diligence]

6
00:02:18,870 --> 00:02:19,680
My Lord.

7
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:21,400
These divers

8
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:23,079
are the best swimmers in the Yan River.

9
00:02:23,079 --> 00:02:24,630
They are all at your disposal, My Lord.

10
00:02:24,630 --> 00:02:26,590
Braving the waves
is a common occurrence for them.

11
00:02:26,590 --> 00:02:28,120
Please take a look, My Lord.

12
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,960
-My Lord.
-My Lord.

13
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:35,190
But there is one thing I don't understand.

14
00:02:32,970 --> 00:02:37,540
[Integrity, Impartiality,
Prudence, and Diligence]

15
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,360
My Lord,

16
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,870
how did you foresee

17
00:02:37,870 --> 00:02:39,800
that Ji Ada would fall into the sea?

18
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,310
I am not a god.

19
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:46,190
How could I have predicted Mr. Ji
falling into the sea?

20
00:02:46,190 --> 00:02:47,190
But aren't these people

21
00:02:47,190 --> 00:02:48,990
you ordered me to find in advance

22
00:02:49,190 --> 00:02:51,590
to salvage the body from the sea?

23
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:59,670
[Integrity, Impartiality,
Prudence, and Diligence]

24
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:56,960
Lord Situ.

25
00:02:58,470 --> 00:02:59,560
The rain today

26
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,840
looks even heavier
than it has been over the past few days.

27
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,750
Indeed.

28
00:03:04,430 --> 00:03:06,590
The flood channel we just built
a few days ago

29
00:03:06,590 --> 00:03:08,790
has been washed away in several places.

30
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:12,350
Then in your opinion,

31
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,840
when will the rain stop?

32
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:18,560
[Integrity, Impartiality,
Prudence, and Diligence]

33
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,820
It will stop tomorrow.

34
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,400
How are things at the Gong family?

35
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,960
No one has left Mingling.

36
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,800
In fact,

37
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:29,200
few people have even left Gong Mansion.

38
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:30,840
Good.

39
00:03:34,750 --> 00:03:36,610
When the rain clears up tomorrow,

40
00:03:37,030 --> 00:03:37,960
the real show

41
00:03:38,430 --> 00:03:39,800
will begin.

42
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:42,800
Open the garden.

43
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:43,520
Yes.

44
00:03:47,590 --> 00:03:49,470
Don't smash it! Don't smash it!

45
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,079
You can't smash it!

46
00:03:51,470 --> 00:03:52,280
You...

47
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:52,960
I...

48
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,280
You can't smash it!

49
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,030
My Lord!

50
00:03:55,750 --> 00:03:56,960
You can't open it, My Lord.

51
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,280
Our Master has already had it divined.

52
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:00,190
This house faces
an inauspicious direction.

53
00:04:00,190 --> 00:04:02,280
That's why it was sealed.

54
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,590
If you smash the lock and open it rashly,

55
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:05,470
it will definitely bring disaster,
My Lord.

56
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:06,800
How dare you, insolent commoner!

57
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,000
If you dare to keep pestering,

58
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:08,840
I will punish you for

59
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,310
obstructing official duties!

60
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:11,120
Open it!

61
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,150
Hold on!

62
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:13,240
Master!

63
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,060
Even the county office

64
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:18,370
cannot force their way
into a private residence, right?

65
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,600
My Lord,

66
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,040
this is Gong Mansion.

67
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:22,750
Appointed by His Majesty,

68
00:04:22,750 --> 00:04:25,010
we handle official maritime transport.

69
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:27,270
Since we both serve the imperial court,

70
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:28,360
I wonder

71
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:30,120
if you could do me a favor.

72
00:04:30,830 --> 00:04:32,430
If there really is a problem,

73
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,390
let's talk inside.

74
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:36,560
Fourth Master Gong.

75
00:04:44,159 --> 00:04:45,290
Fourth Master Gong.

76
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,330
We came to your residence today

77
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,870
not as guests.

78
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,159
The Divine Constable Bureau
is handling a case.

79
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:54,909
[Divine Constable Tally]

80
00:04:51,159 --> 00:04:52,630
Anyone who attempts to obstruct us

81
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:55,120
can be executed under Great Shi law.

82
00:04:56,950 --> 00:04:58,610
So it is the Divine Constable.

83
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:01,360
What brings you here today,

84
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,870
My Lord?

85
00:05:03,630 --> 00:05:05,040
It's nothing major.

86
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:06,960
We are here to save someone.

87
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:08,000
Save someone?

88
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,750
You must be joking, My Lord.

89
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:13,800
This garden of mine

90
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,510
has been closed for years.

91
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,560
Normally,

92
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:18,160
no one ever enters.

93
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,240
So how could there be anyone to save?

94
00:05:20,630 --> 00:05:21,560
A few days ago,

95
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,360
Ji Ada fell into the sea.

96
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,680
Have you heard?

97
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,640
I have indeed heard about it.

98
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,560
But Ji Ada

99
00:05:28,750 --> 00:05:30,360
fell into the sea.

100
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,650
How could he be

101
00:05:31,670 --> 00:05:33,040
in my Cui Garden?

102
00:05:33,630 --> 00:05:35,159
They are not connected.

103
00:05:35,630 --> 00:05:38,230
You are absolutely right,
Fourth Master Gong.

104
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,720
This lake and the sea

105
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,270
are separate entities.

106
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,430
It seems

107
00:05:42,830 --> 00:05:44,430
they are indeed not connected.

108
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:45,870
But who can say for sure

109
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:48,000
that beneath this vast expanse of water,

110
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,600
there are no secret passages

111
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:51,430
or hidden connections?

112
00:05:54,930 --> 00:05:57,550
[Kindness Worthy of Emulation]

113
00:06:16,310 --> 00:06:17,120
My Lord,

114
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,540
what exactly are you trying to do?

115
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:21,070
Divine Constable Li,

116
00:06:21,070 --> 00:06:22,130
please be patient.

117
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,570
In less than four hours,

118
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:24,800
we can search the bottom of this lake

119
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,800
thoroughly.

120
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,480
Good.

121
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:45,720
Stop!

122
00:06:46,190 --> 00:06:48,560
The county office and
the Divine Constable Bureau are investigating a case.

123
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,800
Everyone in the residence

124
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,800
must not leave without permission!

125
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,870
My Lord.

126
00:06:58,190 --> 00:06:59,360
What crime

127
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,000
have I committed?

128
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,800
If you still suspect me

129
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,560
of killing Zhe Shan of the Ji family,

130
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,510
wasn't I already

131
00:07:05,750 --> 00:07:06,720
summoned

132
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:07,750
and questioned?

133
00:07:07,750 --> 00:07:09,610
Don't worry, Fourth Master Gong.

134
00:07:09,950 --> 00:07:11,630
We have already caught the murderer

135
00:07:11,630 --> 00:07:13,070
who killed Zhe Shan.

136
00:07:13,390 --> 00:07:15,390
It indeed has nothing to do with you.

137
00:07:15,630 --> 00:07:16,430
However,

138
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,860
there is another matter right now

139
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:21,800
that is related to you.

140
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:52,870
Huang Mazi?

141
00:07:53,830 --> 00:07:54,800
Weren't you eaten by

142
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,200
the green-haired demon?

143
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,360
It seems

144
00:07:58,950 --> 00:07:59,720
you two

145
00:07:59,740 --> 00:08:01,270
are old acquaintances.

146
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:03,730
Huang Bingshui.

147
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,430
Tell us the evidence

148
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:07,190
of your accusations
against Ji Ada and Gong Sihai

149
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:08,560
in full detail.

150
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:14,720
Yes, My Lord.

151
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:19,360
Everyone in Mingling County knows

152
00:08:19,750 --> 00:08:21,350
that the Gong and Ji families

153
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:23,490
are usually at each other's throats.

154
00:08:23,750 --> 00:08:25,630
They have had many fights over this.

155
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:26,480
But these

156
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:27,480
were all intentionally

157
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:29,040
put on as a show for outsiders.

158
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,570
It's to deceive the public.

159
00:08:31,270 --> 00:08:32,200
Secretly,

160
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:34,760
Gong Sihai and my master

161
00:08:34,789 --> 00:08:36,120
have been colluding with each other.

162
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:36,789
They took the government salt

163
00:08:36,789 --> 00:08:38,270
the Gong family was transporting,

164
00:08:38,270 --> 00:08:39,549
hid it in the Hound Pit,

165
00:08:41,030 --> 00:08:42,360
and made it into salt bricks.

166
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,760
After the heat died down,

167
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,790
they put them into rice bags,

168
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:46,510
disguised them as rice,

169
00:08:46,510 --> 00:08:47,440
and sold them.

170
00:08:47,350 --> 00:08:48,650
[Grain]

171
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,000
This has been going on

172
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,600
for decades.

173
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:52,870
The dirty money

174
00:08:52,870 --> 00:08:54,150
they have made

175
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,390
could already pile up
into mountains of gold and silver.

176
00:08:57,390 --> 00:08:58,030
You...

177
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,840
You are talking nonsense!

178
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,370
Don't be in a hurry to argue.

179
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,960
With all the evidence today,

180
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:06,900
you will definitely not escape punishment.

181
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,440
Found it!

182
00:09:08,630 --> 00:09:09,510
Found it!

183
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,510
Found it!

184
00:09:14,270 --> 00:09:15,170
Found it!

185
00:09:18,790 --> 00:09:19,630
Hurry!

186
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:20,440
Take him away.

187
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,080
Yes.

188
00:09:31,510 --> 00:09:32,320
These...

189
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:34,610
These are all human bones.

190
00:09:34,770 --> 00:09:36,200
How can there be so many human bones?

191
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,240
What's the situation down there?

192
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,150
My Lord,

193
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,760
this is only a small part.

194
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:41,360
There are many more
at the bottom of the lake.

195
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,150
Hurry!

196
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,030
Hurry up and fish them all up!

197
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:44,790
My Lord,

198
00:09:45,030 --> 00:09:47,440
there is something I don't know
if I should say.

199
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,360
Go ahead.

200
00:09:48,790 --> 00:09:49,930
At the bottom of this lake,

201
00:09:49,930 --> 00:09:51,590
not only are there many bones,

202
00:09:51,750 --> 00:09:53,750
but also several large stone locks.

203
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,600
The stone locks
are connected to iron chains.

204
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,630
Some of the iron chains

205
00:09:56,630 --> 00:09:57,960
are wrapped with bones.

206
00:09:59,030 --> 00:10:00,370
In my opinion,

207
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:02,970
they must have been used
to weigh bodies down.

208
00:10:41,630 --> 00:10:43,130
Gong Sihai!

209
00:10:44,790 --> 00:10:46,200
Was it you who sank these people

210
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,550
into the lake?

211
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:50,000
So many lives!

212
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,840
You people...

213
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:54,360
You people are simply insane!

214
00:11:12,580 --> 00:11:13,770
Hao!

215
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,880
Chen!

216
00:11:24,670 --> 00:11:25,630
Hao!

217
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,960
Chen!

218
00:11:33,390 --> 00:11:36,670
My poor children!

219
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,260
After all these years,

220
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:42,000
you must be tired.

221
00:11:50,270 --> 00:11:52,440
Now you can finally lie down

222
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:54,910
and have a good rest.

223
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:59,320
Hao!

224
00:12:01,550 --> 00:12:04,200
Chen!

225
00:12:09,670 --> 00:12:11,670
All I regret is that I've lived this long,

226
00:12:11,670 --> 00:12:13,390
with these broken old bones,

227
00:12:14,150 --> 00:12:16,200
paying tribute to you

228
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,960
night after night,

229
00:12:18,630 --> 00:12:21,630
yet never able to be reunited with you.

230
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:33,910
At long last, I've lived to see this day!

231
00:12:42,270 --> 00:12:43,360
Old Madam Gong

232
00:12:44,030 --> 00:12:46,000
must have seen her family

233
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,840
chained by the feet

234
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:49,100
and sunk into the lake.

235
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,150
Their bodies rotted and swelled,

236
00:12:51,150 --> 00:12:52,280
making them buoyant

237
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:54,080
and causing them
to stand upright in the water

238
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,480
like a forest of corpses.

239
00:12:56,030 --> 00:12:57,690
That's why she always mutters

240
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:00,080
about wanting her family to lie down

241
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,270
and rest well.

242
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,700
Gong Sihai!

243
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:13,830
Even if you die a thousand times,

244
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:16,200
it won't erase the sins

245
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:19,440
you committed against our Gong family!

246
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,730
In the 20th year of Hongyun,

247
00:13:23,390 --> 00:13:26,790
the court appointed the Gong family
to transport government salt.

248
00:13:26,790 --> 00:13:29,000
Soon after, Ji Ada came to our door,

249
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:31,630
proposing to conspire with the Gong family

250
00:13:31,630 --> 00:13:33,000
to smuggle government salt.

251
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:33,840
Madam,

252
00:13:35,030 --> 00:13:36,490
have you made up your mind?

253
00:13:36,940 --> 00:13:39,070
Hao, see the guest out.

254
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:41,510
This way, Mr. Ji.

255
00:13:41,870 --> 00:13:49,740
[Virtue, Diligence, Serenity, and Peace]

256
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:46,940
Who would expect that after that,

257
00:13:47,030 --> 00:13:48,510
Ji Ada would collude with the villain,

258
00:13:48,510 --> 00:13:49,510
Qiu Sihai,

259
00:13:49,850 --> 00:13:52,980
and slaughter almost
the entire Gong family overnight.

260
00:14:01,630 --> 00:14:03,960
Chen!

261
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:17,510
They left the youngest child alive

262
00:14:17,510 --> 00:14:18,510
as a hostage.

263
00:14:19,150 --> 00:14:21,150
To save my only grandson,

264
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:24,270
I had to agree

265
00:14:24,270 --> 00:14:25,580
to their demands.

266
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:26,840
Old Madam Gong,

267
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:28,790
from now on,

268
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:32,270
I will be your nephew.

269
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:40,910
That year,

270
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:44,170
a great plague
happened to break out in Mingling.

271
00:14:44,390 --> 00:14:46,670
So Qiu Sihai spread the rumor,

272
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,870
saying the 13 members of the Gong family

273
00:14:48,870 --> 00:14:50,530
all died suddenly of illness.

274
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,480
Since then,

275
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:55,000
the entire Gong family
fell into the hands

276
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,480
of Ji Ada and this beast

277
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:57,960
surnamed Qiu.

278
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,640
Grandmother.

279
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:03,000
It was all my fault.

280
00:15:03,870 --> 00:15:05,200
I dragged you

281
00:15:05,790 --> 00:15:07,190
and the Gong family down.

282
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:11,090
I am an unfilial grandson.

283
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,200
Don't blame me for not

284
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:16,200
passing the family property to you.

285
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:18,200
I had to hand over the vault key

286
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:19,910
and the ship seal.

287
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:23,290
Only then did they promise
not to kill you.

288
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:26,150
I have never blamed you.

289
00:15:42,870 --> 00:15:44,000
Fourth Master Gong.

290
00:15:44,750 --> 00:15:45,550
No.

291
00:15:46,760 --> 00:15:48,480
I should call you Qiu Sihai,

292
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,200
Chief Qiu.

293
00:15:50,630 --> 00:15:51,550
This time,

294
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:54,150
you are in big trouble.

295
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:55,630
Murder and robbery,

296
00:15:56,150 --> 00:15:57,610
theft of government salt,

297
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:00,290
and embezzlement of public funds.

298
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:02,080
I don't think even 100 heads
would be enough

299
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:02,960
for all your crimes.

300
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:03,670
Shut up!

301
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:05,870
I think you just

302
00:16:05,870 --> 00:16:07,470
have too many heads to spare!

303
00:16:07,630 --> 00:16:09,440
I'm sure you all know

304
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:11,720
who the Ji brothers are.

305
00:16:11,870 --> 00:16:13,300
Over the years,

306
00:16:13,750 --> 00:16:16,000
how much of the money
the Gong family earned,

307
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,750
both openly and secretly,

308
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:20,200
actually went into my pocket?

309
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,390
The Divine Constable Bureau?

310
00:16:25,390 --> 00:16:28,150
Under imperial power,
everything is the same.

311
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:30,870
Take my advice.

312
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:33,410
A wise man knows
when to yield to circumstances.

313
00:16:33,410 --> 00:16:34,630
Since you

314
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:36,550
came here on the Gong family's ship,

315
00:16:36,550 --> 00:16:38,910
I'll send you back

316
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,720
in style.

317
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:43,270
Don't make me do this the hard way.

318
00:16:44,150 --> 00:16:46,080
If this matter really blows up

319
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:48,270
and the one above holds us accountable,

320
00:16:48,270 --> 00:16:50,220
no one can bear the consequences!

321
00:16:52,030 --> 00:16:53,320
Hearing you say this,

322
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:56,200
it seems we are in big trouble.

323
00:16:57,550 --> 00:16:59,150
What should we do?

324
00:17:00,660 --> 00:17:01,920
Lord Constable Ghost,

325
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:03,120
what do you think?

326
00:17:04,069 --> 00:17:04,960
Sorry,

327
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,640
I only know how to kill.

328
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,000
Lady Constable Frost?

329
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:11,829
I only know how to perform autopsies.

330
00:17:11,829 --> 00:17:12,790
In that case...

331
00:17:13,030 --> 00:17:14,200
One kills,

332
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:16,410
and the other performs autopsies.

333
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:17,589
It seems

334
00:17:17,790 --> 00:17:18,660
you'll end up dead

335
00:17:18,660 --> 00:17:20,200
either way.

336
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,680
Stop bluffing!

337
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:25,260
Who in Mingling doesn't know

338
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:27,060
who's behind the Ji brothers?

339
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:28,480
Who dares name

340
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:30,400
the real mastermind?

341
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:32,580
I don't think any of you do!

342
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:34,430
The one who instructed Ji Ada

343
00:17:34,790 --> 00:17:36,680
to collude with Gong's Shipping

344
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:39,800
to resell government salt
and line his own pockets

345
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:43,620
is His Highness Prince Ding of Great Shi,

346
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:45,300
the First Prince,

347
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:46,550
Zhou Miao.

348
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:56,830
Lord Li.

349
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:58,480
I know you are upright,

350
00:17:58,640 --> 00:17:59,640
but some things

351
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:01,170
shouldn't be said out loud.

352
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:02,310
Why not?

353
00:18:03,750 --> 00:18:04,960
Right and wrong,

354
00:18:05,030 --> 00:18:06,410
good and evil,

355
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,590
will be judged.

356
00:18:08,350 --> 00:18:09,920
There is justice in heaven,

357
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:11,750
and fairness in people's hearts.

358
00:18:11,750 --> 00:18:13,560
Even if it's someone close to His Majesty

359
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:14,960
within the imperial walls—

360
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:16,820
if a prince breaks the law,

361
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:19,090
he should be punished like a commoner.

362
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:33,720
Well said.

363
00:18:44,830 --> 00:18:46,680
Then I

364
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,680
will go with you today.

365
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,510
I'd like to see

366
00:18:50,510 --> 00:18:51,510
how you will face the wrath

367
00:18:51,510 --> 00:18:55,110
of the one on the throne.

368
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:57,510
Please!

369
00:19:03,310 --> 00:19:05,090
[Mingling County Government]

370
00:19:06,550 --> 00:19:07,350
Don't move!

371
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:08,920
Hurry up!

372
00:19:09,350 --> 00:19:10,550
On the Gong family's ships,

373
00:19:10,550 --> 00:19:11,440
we did indeed find

374
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,750
a lot of embezzled government salt.

375
00:19:12,590 --> 00:19:18,890
[Integrity, Impartiality,
Prudence, and Diligence]

376
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,240
-When we got on the ships,
-Move!

377
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,750
many of the Gong family's lackeys

378
00:19:15,750 --> 00:19:17,550
were mixing seawater into the bags

379
00:19:17,550 --> 00:19:18,960
in an attempt to destroy the evidence.

380
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:19,490
Hurry up!

381
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,620
Now that the cases are solved,

382
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:23,830
I wonder when you Divine Constables

383
00:19:23,830 --> 00:19:25,160
will set off,

384
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:26,790
so I can make arrangements.

385
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:34,110
No rush.

386
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:35,960
Let's wait a bit longer.

387
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:38,200
What are you waiting for?

388
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:39,960
My Lord.

389
00:19:40,830 --> 00:19:41,640
My Lord.

390
00:19:42,590 --> 00:19:44,270
My Lord. Divine Constable.

391
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,590
We found Ji Ada.

392
00:19:45,350 --> 00:19:46,450
[Breezes of Grace and Harmony]

393
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:46,720
How was he found?

394
00:19:46,830 --> 00:19:48,200
The body was washed up on the beach.

395
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:50,600
It was found by beachcombers this morning.

396
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,060
Second Master,

397
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:21,000
don't worry too much.

398
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:23,200
Now that he has been found,

399
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:24,590
there's no need to rush.

400
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:26,240
Xiuniang.

401
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:29,400
I'm not anxious about my brother

402
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:31,130
not being able to rest in peace.

403
00:20:31,350 --> 00:20:33,410
He clearly fell into the sea and died,

404
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:34,750
but the county government

405
00:20:34,750 --> 00:20:35,790
wants to hand the body over

406
00:20:35,790 --> 00:20:37,830
to the Divine Constable Bureau
for examination.

407
00:20:37,830 --> 00:20:39,350
This doesn't make sense.

408
00:20:41,590 --> 00:20:42,400
Unless

409
00:20:42,830 --> 00:20:44,160
there's a hidden truth.

410
00:20:44,590 --> 00:20:45,440
Maybe...

411
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:47,440
Maybe the county magistrate

412
00:20:47,440 --> 00:20:49,240
just wants to save some trouble.

413
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,000
No.

414
00:20:51,790 --> 00:20:52,990
It's still not right.

415
00:20:53,070 --> 00:20:54,720
Second Master, be careful!

416
00:20:54,830 --> 00:20:55,690
Second Master!

417
00:20:55,830 --> 00:20:56,690
Second Master.

418
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:58,030
The Divine Constable Bureau
is handling a case.

419
00:20:58,030 --> 00:20:58,790
No trespassing.

420
00:20:58,790 --> 00:20:59,510
Step back.

421
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:00,650
Handling a case?

422
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:02,200
What case?

423
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:03,680
I'm looking for my brother.

424
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:04,680
Let me in!

425
00:21:05,190 --> 00:21:11,500
[Coroner's Office]

426
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:08,200
Come on. Sit down.

427
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:13,590
What's wrong?

428
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:15,270
Is something wrong?

429
00:21:15,830 --> 00:21:17,270
The cause of Ji Ada's death

430
00:21:17,270 --> 00:21:19,110
was not simply drowning.

431
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:21,200
To be precise,

432
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:23,680
drowning was just one of the causes.

433
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:24,960
Look.

434
00:21:25,750 --> 00:21:27,100
The deceased's head and neck

435
00:21:27,100 --> 00:21:28,690
are covered in deep wounds.

436
00:21:37,830 --> 00:21:39,270
Isn't this because

437
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:41,070
the sharp reefs on the seabed

438
00:21:41,070 --> 00:21:42,240
and the strong waves

439
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:44,000
caused these injuries?

440
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:45,900
Then why are there no wounds

441
00:21:45,900 --> 00:21:47,160
on the rest of the body,

442
00:21:47,350 --> 00:21:49,310
but only on the head and face?

443
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:52,480
It could also have been caused
by a large fish bite.

444
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:54,280
But it wouldn't be fatal.

445
00:21:54,750 --> 00:21:56,070
It's not impossible.

446
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:57,440
However...

447
00:21:58,270 --> 00:22:00,070
I saw this wound.

448
00:22:00,270 --> 00:22:01,550
Although the body is severely decomposed

449
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:02,750
and hard to identify,

450
00:22:02,830 --> 00:22:03,790
take a look.

451
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:05,960
This peculiar wound—

452
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:07,860
doesn't it look familiar?

453
00:22:11,350 --> 00:22:13,160
Ji Ada, like Zhe Shan, had his throat

454
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:14,820
crushed by an animal's teeth.

455
00:22:15,070 --> 00:22:17,270
He must have been severely bitten first

456
00:22:17,550 --> 00:22:19,210
and then drowned in the water.

457
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:21,000
So,

458
00:22:21,350 --> 00:22:22,590
he had been ashore?

459
00:22:23,070 --> 00:22:24,070
That couldn't be.

460
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:25,960
When Ji Ada fell

461
00:22:25,960 --> 00:22:27,070
from the Tingchao Boat,

462
00:22:27,070 --> 00:22:28,240
we had just locked Xia Jiuying

463
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:29,200
in prison.

464
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:30,880
Besides,

465
00:22:31,070 --> 00:22:33,440
the demon wolf was killed by Lou Tianming.

466
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:35,400
How could it bite Ji Ada to death

467
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:36,640
when he came ashore?

468
00:22:37,790 --> 00:22:38,640
Could it be...

469
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:42,000
that he wasn't bitten
by the green-haired demon?

470
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:43,000
In that case...

471
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:45,880
it should have been Black Silk Leopard.

472
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,030
So Ji Ada

473
00:22:49,350 --> 00:22:51,210
finally managed to climb ashore,

474
00:22:51,270 --> 00:22:52,070
only to

475
00:22:52,350 --> 00:22:55,070
have Gong Sihai sic his dog on him.

476
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:57,270
The Ji and Gong families

477
00:22:57,270 --> 00:22:59,070
were colluding to sell government salt.

478
00:22:59,070 --> 00:23:00,270
Gong Sihai had no reason to kill

479
00:23:00,270 --> 00:23:01,200
his partner.

480
00:23:01,240 --> 00:23:02,960
Seeing that we were onto them,

481
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:05,000
he silenced him.

482
00:23:08,270 --> 00:23:10,240
Rather than silencing him, which would

483
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:12,240
only cause trouble
without gaining anything,

484
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:14,400
it would've been much simpler

485
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:15,590
to rely on the Ji family

486
00:23:15,590 --> 00:23:17,030
for protection.

487
00:23:17,790 --> 00:23:19,880
Gong Sihai indeed had

488
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:21,400
no motive to kill Ji Ada.

489
00:23:22,050 --> 00:23:24,220
The killer is someone else.

490
00:23:25,350 --> 00:23:26,160
This person

491
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:29,020
can also control Black Silk Leopard.

492
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:36,100
The Ji family came to Mingling

493
00:23:36,350 --> 00:23:37,880
in the 20th year of Hongyun.

494
00:23:39,030 --> 00:23:40,440
That was also the year the Gong family

495
00:23:40,440 --> 00:23:41,720
ran into trouble and began conspiring

496
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:42,750
with the Ji family

497
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,680
to resell government salt.

498
00:23:46,270 --> 00:23:48,240
It was right after
my eldest and second brothers

499
00:23:48,240 --> 00:23:49,790
conspired against me.

500
00:23:52,120 --> 00:23:54,680
The man behind the Ji family
is Eldest Brother.

501
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:56,160
And Xiu Wei, the key figure

502
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:57,070
in the false military intelligence report

503
00:23:57,070 --> 00:23:58,880
he issued
while he was in the Ministry of War,

504
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:00,550
disappeared in Mingling.

505
00:24:02,240 --> 00:24:03,030
As expected,

506
00:24:04,240 --> 00:24:06,240
it all ties together now.

507
00:24:13,590 --> 00:24:14,450
Second Master,

508
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:17,350
it's time to go back
and take your medicine.

509
00:24:17,350 --> 00:24:19,030
At a time like this,

510
00:24:19,550 --> 00:24:21,070
you're talking about taking medicine?

511
00:24:21,070 --> 00:24:21,930
Second Master!

512
00:24:22,440 --> 00:24:23,160
Let's go.

513
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:24,550
You must take care of your health.

514
00:24:24,550 --> 00:24:25,480
Let's go back.

515
00:24:25,590 --> 00:24:26,310
Waiting here

516
00:24:26,310 --> 00:24:27,650
is not a solution.

517
00:24:27,680 --> 00:24:29,550
Let's go back and take your medicine.

518
00:24:29,550 --> 00:24:30,350
Ji Er!

519
00:24:30,790 --> 00:24:31,590
My Lord?

520
00:24:31,340 --> 00:24:34,620
[Coroner's Office]

521
00:24:35,030 --> 00:24:36,160
My Lord,

522
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:38,270
can you let me in

523
00:24:38,750 --> 00:24:40,240
and take my brother away?

524
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:41,480
Ji Er,

525
00:24:41,750 --> 00:24:42,910
do you know that Ji Ada

526
00:24:42,910 --> 00:24:44,680
is suspected of colluding with Gong Sihai

527
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:46,490
and reselling government salt?

528
00:24:46,680 --> 00:24:48,880
I heard it from the servants
on the way here.

529
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:49,680
My Lord,

530
00:24:50,240 --> 00:24:51,480
is this true?

531
00:24:51,350 --> 00:24:55,810
[Coroner's Office]

532
00:24:54,240 --> 00:24:55,920
I will have the entire Ji Mansion

533
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:56,830
and everyone in it,

534
00:24:56,830 --> 00:24:59,200
including all properties, seized!

535
00:24:59,400 --> 00:25:00,550
Second Young Master Ji,

536
00:25:00,550 --> 00:25:01,810
please lead the way

537
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:03,270
to Ji Mansion!

538
00:25:03,750 --> 00:25:04,550
My Lord,

539
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:07,000
why are you seizing Ji Mansion?

540
00:25:09,070 --> 00:25:09,880
My Lord!

541
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:12,540
Second Master!

542
00:25:13,070 --> 00:25:13,930
Second Master!

543
00:25:14,750 --> 00:25:15,610
Second Master!

544
00:25:16,230 --> 00:25:17,030
My Lord,

545
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:18,890
our Second Master is innocent!

546
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:20,680
He has been in poor health
since childhood.

547
00:25:20,680 --> 00:25:22,270
He has always been controlled
and restricted

548
00:25:22,270 --> 00:25:23,130
by his brother.

549
00:25:23,200 --> 00:25:24,850
He was never allowed

550
00:25:24,880 --> 00:25:25,640
to handle any affairs

551
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:26,790
in the mansion.

552
00:25:26,790 --> 00:25:27,480
How could he know anything

553
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:29,410
about reselling government salt?

554
00:25:29,470 --> 00:25:32,300
[Integrity, Impartiality,
Prudence, and Diligence]

555
00:25:29,550 --> 00:25:31,030
Now that his brother has just passed away,

556
00:25:31,030 --> 00:25:32,430
you're saying such things.

557
00:25:32,430 --> 00:25:32,960
Aren't you

558
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:34,820
trying to kill our Second Master?

559
00:25:36,050 --> 00:25:38,600
[Coroner's Office]

560
00:25:36,640 --> 00:25:38,200
Go get a doctor now.

561
00:25:38,200 --> 00:25:38,880
Yes.

562
00:25:38,600 --> 00:25:39,540
[As Bright as the Sun and Moon]

563
00:25:40,640 --> 00:25:41,830
Hurry up and help him

564
00:25:41,830 --> 00:25:43,030
to the back hall to rest!

565
00:25:42,940 --> 00:25:47,230
[As Bright as the Sun and Moon]

566
00:25:43,070 --> 00:25:43,880
Yes.

567
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,030
Come on.

568
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:51,730
Come on, Second Master.

569
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:00,060
Young Master Gong.

570
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:02,500
Letting you in to visit

571
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:04,040
is already an exception.

572
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:06,350
If you have anything to say,
say it quickly.

573
00:26:06,350 --> 00:26:07,480
Thank you, officer.

574
00:26:13,960 --> 00:26:14,750
Jiuying!

575
00:26:15,640 --> 00:26:16,480
Jiuying!

576
00:26:18,750 --> 00:26:19,550
Jiuying!

577
00:26:25,480 --> 00:26:26,240
Hurry up.

578
00:26:32,470 --> 00:26:33,400
Jiuying.

579
00:26:45,790 --> 00:26:46,790
I heard

580
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:49,370
that the terrible green-haired demon

581
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:51,010
is your alpha wolf.

582
00:26:51,790 --> 00:26:52,650
Why did you never

583
00:26:52,650 --> 00:26:53,770
tell me about it?

584
00:26:58,070 --> 00:26:59,720
Alpha wolf...

585
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:05,400
It's dead...

586
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:14,700
It's dead!

587
00:27:15,920 --> 00:27:17,110
You like it so much,

588
00:27:17,550 --> 00:27:19,210
and it listened to you so well.

589
00:27:19,720 --> 00:27:21,520
You must have been good friends.

590
00:27:25,350 --> 00:27:27,070
I thought you were like me,

591
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:29,290
having only one friend.

592
00:27:31,160 --> 00:27:33,680
But I hope you will have

593
00:27:33,680 --> 00:27:35,550
many more friends.

594
00:27:37,960 --> 00:27:38,830
You and I

595
00:27:39,880 --> 00:27:41,280
are different after all.

596
00:28:02,640 --> 00:28:03,510
Don't worry.

597
00:28:06,790 --> 00:28:07,960
You'll be fine.

598
00:28:09,030 --> 00:28:10,550
You didn't kill Zhe Shan.

599
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:12,480
I know

600
00:28:13,070 --> 00:28:14,800
you would never let your friend

601
00:28:15,240 --> 00:28:16,350
kill for you.

602
00:28:17,310 --> 00:28:18,350
You never had

603
00:28:18,350 --> 00:28:20,010
the intention to kill anyone.

604
00:28:21,510 --> 00:28:24,350
The Divine Constable Bureau
will find out the truth

605
00:28:24,350 --> 00:28:25,640
and clear your name.

606
00:28:26,830 --> 00:28:28,030
When that time comes,

607
00:28:28,750 --> 00:28:29,830
leave Mingling.

608
00:28:32,110 --> 00:28:33,570
Go anywhere you want to go.

609
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:37,920
Go see

610
00:28:37,920 --> 00:28:39,320
the outside world for me.

611
00:28:56,110 --> 00:28:57,310
Divine Constable Li.

612
00:28:57,880 --> 00:28:59,130
The kitchen has prepared

613
00:28:59,130 --> 00:29:00,260
a few simple dishes.

614
00:29:00,510 --> 00:29:02,030
It's just plain food.

615
00:29:02,030 --> 00:29:03,690
Please don't mind it, My Lord.

616
00:29:07,510 --> 00:29:08,720
Where is your lord?

617
00:29:08,920 --> 00:29:09,680
Why not

618
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:12,240
ask him to come and eat together?

619
00:29:13,440 --> 00:29:15,640
The heavy rain the day before yesterday
washed away the flood channel.

620
00:29:15,640 --> 00:29:16,430
Our lord

621
00:29:16,450 --> 00:29:18,110
is busy investigating the Ji family

622
00:29:18,110 --> 00:29:19,310
and repairing the channel.

623
00:29:19,310 --> 00:29:20,880
He is completely tied up.

624
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:21,790
I'll deliver his meal

625
00:29:21,790 --> 00:29:23,640
to the construction site later.

626
00:29:25,110 --> 00:29:26,040
Enjoy your meal.

627
00:29:26,110 --> 00:29:26,920
Alright.

628
00:29:42,480 --> 00:29:43,310
Put it here.

629
00:29:43,510 --> 00:29:44,680
Come on, come on.

630
00:29:44,680 --> 00:29:45,400
Careful.

631
00:29:53,150 --> 00:29:54,500
Give me a hand.

632
00:29:57,400 --> 00:29:58,440
It's almost done.

633
00:30:04,640 --> 00:30:05,440
Lai.

634
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:07,680
Did Young Master Gong

635
00:30:07,830 --> 00:30:08,920
go to the prison

636
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:10,630
to visit Xia Jiuying?

637
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:13,110
Divine Constable Li,
you truly are clairvoyant.

638
00:30:13,110 --> 00:30:14,310
As you instructed,

639
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:15,930
I arranged for them to meet.

640
00:30:16,310 --> 00:30:18,770
Please enjoy your meal, Divine Constables.

641
00:30:20,270 --> 00:30:21,400
Guys, listen to me.

642
00:30:22,030 --> 00:30:23,680
The number one coroner of Great Shi

643
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:25,080
has made a new discovery.

644
00:30:27,920 --> 00:30:29,310
I found a strange mark

645
00:30:29,310 --> 00:30:30,920
on the deceased's face.

646
00:30:33,070 --> 00:30:34,030
What mark?

647
00:30:34,590 --> 00:30:36,030
After she told me,

648
00:30:36,270 --> 00:30:37,930
I observed it for a long time,

649
00:30:38,310 --> 00:30:39,680
but I just couldn't see it.

650
00:30:39,680 --> 00:30:40,480
Of course,

651
00:30:40,720 --> 00:30:42,580
I didn't dare to look too closely.

652
00:30:42,920 --> 00:30:44,000
It made me sick.

653
00:30:44,920 --> 00:30:46,440
Right in the middle of the face,

654
00:30:46,440 --> 00:30:47,410
there is a very faint,

655
00:30:47,410 --> 00:30:49,210
very light brown mark.

656
00:30:49,240 --> 00:30:50,680
You can't see it
if you don't look closely.

657
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:52,030
Even I almost missed it.

658
00:30:52,480 --> 00:30:53,680
A brown mark?

659
00:30:54,640 --> 00:30:55,830
Could it be

660
00:30:56,270 --> 00:30:57,480
some kind of bruise?

661
00:30:58,110 --> 00:31:00,680
I think it looks more like
the person was exposed

662
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:01,680
to the sun after death,

663
00:31:01,680 --> 00:31:02,880
leaving a sunburn.

664
00:31:05,830 --> 00:31:06,680
Sunburn?

665
00:31:07,400 --> 00:31:08,860
The sun is harsh out at sea.

666
00:31:08,920 --> 00:31:10,310
After floating on the surface

667
00:31:10,310 --> 00:31:11,440
for several days,

668
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:13,240
a body can easily get sunburned.

669
00:31:14,030 --> 00:31:15,310
As far as I know,

670
00:31:15,640 --> 00:31:17,680
men's Yang energy gathers in the face,

671
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:19,880
making the face heavy,
so drowned men always float face down.

672
00:31:19,880 --> 00:31:21,830
Women's Yin energy gathers in the back,

673
00:31:21,830 --> 00:31:24,110
making the back heavy,
so drowned women always float face up.

674
00:31:24,110 --> 00:31:25,950
Therefore,
male corpses generally float face down,

675
00:31:25,950 --> 00:31:27,720
while female corpses float face up.

676
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:29,830
How could a corpse floating face down

677
00:31:30,270 --> 00:31:32,110
get sunburned?

678
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:33,610
Those are

679
00:31:33,630 --> 00:31:34,880
just superstitions, after all.

680
00:31:34,880 --> 00:31:36,590
They may not be entirely credible.

681
00:31:36,590 --> 00:31:37,690
And based on my previous

682
00:31:37,690 --> 00:31:39,070
experience with floating corpse cases,

683
00:31:39,070 --> 00:31:40,480
there are many exceptions.

684
00:31:40,480 --> 00:31:41,680
But the problem is

685
00:31:42,200 --> 00:31:43,930
the shape of that sunburn mark.

686
00:31:53,830 --> 00:31:54,990
It's as if only a single beam of sunlight

687
00:31:54,990 --> 00:31:56,750
came down from the sky

688
00:31:59,070 --> 00:32:00,730
and burned just this one spot.

689
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:05,520
Don't you find that strange?

690
00:32:05,830 --> 00:32:06,920
Logically speaking,

691
00:32:06,920 --> 00:32:09,270
if the body had been burned by the sun
while floating at sea,

692
00:32:09,270 --> 00:32:10,160
the entire face

693
00:32:10,190 --> 00:32:11,590
should have been burned.

694
00:32:14,030 --> 00:32:15,200
In that case,

695
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:17,130
there is only one possibility.

696
00:32:17,270 --> 00:32:18,270
The body

697
00:32:18,400 --> 00:32:20,070
wasn't dumped into the sea
right after death.

698
00:32:20,070 --> 00:32:20,880
It was kept

699
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:22,720
somewhere

700
00:32:23,310 --> 00:32:25,240
with direct sunlight

701
00:32:25,440 --> 00:32:26,570
for some time first.

702
00:32:26,640 --> 00:32:27,440
Right.

703
00:32:27,790 --> 00:32:29,000
For a corpse to develop sunburn marks,

704
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:30,680
it takes at least 2 days.

705
00:32:31,270 --> 00:32:31,790
However,

706
00:32:31,790 --> 00:32:33,790
judging from the degree of decomposition,

707
00:32:33,790 --> 00:32:35,310
the time the body
was thrown into the water

708
00:32:35,310 --> 00:32:36,500
matches the time Ji Ada

709
00:32:36,500 --> 00:32:38,100
fell into the sea that night.

710
00:32:38,510 --> 00:32:39,510
Let me do the math.

711
00:32:39,830 --> 00:32:41,110
We spent 3 days

712
00:32:41,310 --> 00:32:43,110
just looking for him.

713
00:32:43,480 --> 00:32:44,830
Then it rained for a day.

714
00:32:45,070 --> 00:32:46,680
And we spent another day retrieving
the bodies in Gong Mansion.

715
00:32:46,680 --> 00:32:47,790
Until the body was found,

716
00:32:47,790 --> 00:32:49,000
it was 5 days in total.

717
00:32:49,110 --> 00:32:51,640
Could he have been exposed to the sun
for 2 days

718
00:32:52,030 --> 00:32:53,830
and then soaked in the sea for 3 days?

719
00:32:53,830 --> 00:32:55,070
Three days and five days

720
00:32:55,070 --> 00:32:55,960
are such a big difference.

721
00:32:55,960 --> 00:32:57,400
You think I can't tell?

722
00:32:57,400 --> 00:32:58,400
I'm sure

723
00:32:58,400 --> 00:32:59,310
it was 5 days.

724
00:32:59,790 --> 00:33:01,310
Even if Ji Ada went ashore

725
00:33:01,310 --> 00:33:03,110
and drowned after his throat was crushed,

726
00:33:03,110 --> 00:33:04,480
his time on shore

727
00:33:04,920 --> 00:33:06,380
must have been very short.

728
00:33:09,920 --> 00:33:11,050
Where are you going?

729
00:33:11,070 --> 00:33:11,920
Eat first.

730
00:33:11,920 --> 00:33:12,680
I'm full.

731
00:33:14,640 --> 00:33:16,880
Judging from the shape of the sunburn,

732
00:33:17,310 --> 00:33:18,880
the first place Ji Ada's body was dumped

733
00:33:18,880 --> 00:33:20,000
was not the sea.

734
00:33:21,720 --> 00:33:22,720
He fell into the sea,

735
00:33:22,720 --> 00:33:23,510
came ashore,

736
00:33:23,790 --> 00:33:25,120
had his throat crushed,

737
00:33:26,070 --> 00:33:27,110
drowned,

738
00:33:27,110 --> 00:33:28,440
developed sunburn marks,

739
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:30,370
then was dumped into the sea again.

740
00:33:31,790 --> 00:33:33,000
The body had to remain there
for at least 2 days

741
00:33:33,000 --> 00:33:34,510
without being discovered,

742
00:33:34,510 --> 00:33:35,680
with the face up

743
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:38,400
and a single beam of sunlight
shining on it.

744
00:33:38,510 --> 00:33:39,720
And during this whole time,

745
00:33:39,720 --> 00:33:41,830
the body had to stay in the water.

746
00:33:42,790 --> 00:33:44,510
What kind of place

747
00:33:45,310 --> 00:33:47,170
could meet all these conditions?

748
00:33:48,510 --> 00:33:49,470
Could...

749
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:52,310
someone in this county
have built a secret water prison

750
00:33:52,310 --> 00:33:53,790
to hold people?

751
00:34:11,230 --> 00:34:14,290
You are not allowed
to meddle in the mansion's affairs!

752
00:34:16,320 --> 00:34:17,110
Please,

753
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:18,280
save my friend!

754
00:34:22,110 --> 00:34:23,679
The entire Gong Mansion

755
00:34:23,920 --> 00:34:25,070
hasn't belonged to the Gong family
for a long time!

756
00:34:25,070 --> 00:34:26,920
Hao!

757
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:29,400
You!

758
00:34:36,630 --> 00:34:36,850
[This Sihai is fake.
He's illegally selling government salt]

759
00:34:41,800 --> 00:34:43,460
Have you thought of anything?

760
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:45,070
Not yet.

761
00:34:45,840 --> 00:34:46,630
Get up.

762
00:34:48,440 --> 00:34:49,639
Wait a little longer.

763
00:34:53,580 --> 00:34:55,600
[Integrity, Impartiality,
Prudence, and Diligence]

764
00:34:54,840 --> 00:34:55,900
Divine Constable.

765
00:34:56,400 --> 00:34:57,190
Hurry.

766
00:34:58,600 --> 00:34:59,160
Put that

767
00:34:59,190 --> 00:34:59,960
over there.

768
00:35:00,920 --> 00:35:02,030
What are you doing?

769
00:35:02,710 --> 00:35:04,030
Our lord asked us to take this stone table

770
00:35:04,030 --> 00:35:05,000
and use it to build the flood channel.

771
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:05,710
Hurry up. Let's go.

772
00:35:05,710 --> 00:35:06,400
Let's go.

773
00:35:14,920 --> 00:35:15,880
I see.

774
00:35:19,630 --> 00:35:20,440
Qingyang,

775
00:35:20,480 --> 00:35:21,880
what are you looking for?

776
00:35:24,000 --> 00:35:25,140
I don't know.

777
00:35:26,320 --> 00:35:27,870
It could be an object,

778
00:35:28,110 --> 00:35:29,160
or it could be

779
00:35:29,920 --> 00:35:31,520
a trace.

780
00:35:32,070 --> 00:35:32,880
Anyway,

781
00:35:33,400 --> 00:35:35,060
it must be something unusual.

782
00:35:36,320 --> 00:35:38,380
Whenever a murderer commits a crime,

783
00:35:38,670 --> 00:35:40,670
they will definitely leave traces.

784
00:35:41,070 --> 00:35:42,800
You are searching along the flood channel.

785
00:35:42,800 --> 00:35:44,510
Do you think the murderer

786
00:35:44,510 --> 00:35:45,460
has something to do with it?

787
00:35:45,460 --> 00:35:46,730
Don't you think

788
00:35:46,840 --> 00:35:48,090
this flood channel,

789
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:49,780
about the width of a person

790
00:35:49,800 --> 00:35:51,400
and covered with stone slabs,

791
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:52,360
is the perfect place

792
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:54,340
to hide a body?

793
00:35:54,710 --> 00:35:56,320
What's more brilliant is that

794
00:35:56,320 --> 00:35:57,920
not only can it hide bodies,

795
00:35:57,920 --> 00:35:59,880
but it can also be used to move them.

796
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:01,240
So,

797
00:36:01,480 --> 00:36:03,140
this is the real dumping site.

798
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:08,590
Situ Bo is leading his men
to carry out earthworks everywhere.

799
00:36:08,590 --> 00:36:09,860
These flood channels

800
00:36:10,030 --> 00:36:11,690
are all over the city.

801
00:36:15,480 --> 00:36:16,280
So,

802
00:36:16,800 --> 00:36:18,070
as long as we determine

803
00:36:18,060 --> 00:36:19,030
[Reservoir] [Secret Channel]

804
00:36:18,670 --> 00:36:19,840
which section of the flood channel

805
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:21,800
the body was hidden in,

806
00:36:22,440 --> 00:36:24,320
we will find the crime scene.

807
00:36:44,280 --> 00:36:46,110
There used to be a stone here.

808
00:36:46,880 --> 00:36:48,840
Judging from the moss around,

809
00:36:49,400 --> 00:36:50,320
it's about...

810
00:37:03,150 --> 00:37:04,960
No wonder the head and neck of the body

811
00:37:04,960 --> 00:37:06,150
had so many wounds.

812
00:37:06,800 --> 00:37:09,510
This must be the crime scene.

813
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:12,440
Although the heavy rain overnight

814
00:37:12,470 --> 00:37:13,920
washed the bloodstains on the ground away

815
00:37:13,920 --> 00:37:15,400
completely,

816
00:37:15,550 --> 00:37:16,360
there

817
00:37:16,710 --> 00:37:18,440
must still be traces to follow.

818
00:37:44,190 --> 00:37:44,960
Right here.

819
00:37:44,980 --> 00:37:46,420
Come on, open it.

820
00:37:53,300 --> 00:37:54,090
Let me do it.

821
00:37:57,710 --> 00:37:58,510
Be careful!

822
00:37:58,920 --> 00:37:59,710
Come on!

823
00:38:00,510 --> 00:38:01,320
Come on!

824
00:38:02,710 --> 00:38:03,510
Careful.

825
00:38:11,550 --> 00:38:12,360
How is it?

826
00:38:14,800 --> 00:38:16,330
Just give me 2 days,

827
00:38:16,480 --> 00:38:17,920
and I can give you a sunburn mark

828
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,850
exactly like the one on the victim.

829
00:38:25,110 --> 00:38:25,880
Careful.

830
00:38:33,320 --> 00:38:34,230
Obviously,

831
00:38:34,710 --> 00:38:36,560
the killer must know
the weather in Mingling

832
00:38:36,560 --> 00:38:37,960
like the back of his hand.

833
00:38:38,480 --> 00:38:39,710
He first manipulated

834
00:38:39,880 --> 00:38:41,190
Black Silk Leopard

835
00:38:41,210 --> 00:38:43,140
to crush the victim's throat here,

836
00:38:43,320 --> 00:38:44,110
and then

837
00:38:44,320 --> 00:38:46,190
threw him into the flood channel.

838
00:38:46,630 --> 00:38:47,510
Next,

839
00:38:47,710 --> 00:38:49,570
he just needed to wait patiently.

840
00:38:49,840 --> 00:38:51,000
Because he knew

841
00:38:51,700 --> 00:38:52,990
that in two days,

842
00:38:53,190 --> 00:38:55,440
there would be a heavy rain.

843
00:38:56,320 --> 00:38:57,480
Lord Situ.

844
00:38:57,570 --> 00:39:01,630
[Integrity, Impartiality,
Prudence, and Diligence]

845
00:38:58,030 --> 00:38:59,030
The rain today

846
00:38:59,630 --> 00:39:01,960
seems even heavier than the past few days.

847
00:39:02,030 --> 00:39:03,000
Indeed.

848
00:39:03,280 --> 00:39:04,110
The flood channel we just built

849
00:39:04,110 --> 00:39:05,880
a few days ago has been washed away

850
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:07,190
in several places.

851
00:39:07,480 --> 00:39:08,750
In your opinion,

852
00:39:09,110 --> 00:39:11,280
when will the rain stop?

853
00:39:11,670 --> 00:39:12,930
It will stop tomorrow.

854
00:39:13,190 --> 00:39:14,320
A day of heavy rain

855
00:39:14,590 --> 00:39:16,190
was enough to form a torrent,

856
00:39:16,190 --> 00:39:18,800
washing the body down the flood channel

857
00:39:18,920 --> 00:39:20,580
all the way into the Yan River,

858
00:39:20,590 --> 00:39:22,970
then from the river into the sea,

859
00:39:23,110 --> 00:39:25,190
until it washed ashore

860
00:39:25,320 --> 00:39:26,450
and was discovered.

861
00:39:27,190 --> 00:39:28,480
Just like this,

862
00:39:28,840 --> 00:39:29,800
the killer

863
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:32,430
disposed of the body effortlessly

864
00:39:32,430 --> 00:39:33,320
without

865
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:35,190
even leaving the house.

866
00:39:35,710 --> 00:39:36,630
But

867
00:39:37,070 --> 00:39:38,710
we watched with our own eyes

868
00:39:38,710 --> 00:39:39,880
as Ji Ada

869
00:39:40,110 --> 00:39:42,370
fell into the sea from the Tingchao Boat.

870
00:39:43,030 --> 00:39:44,780
How could he end up here

871
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:46,190
and get bitten by a dog?

872
00:39:47,320 --> 00:39:49,480
There is one more thing to confirm.

873
00:39:50,800 --> 00:39:51,360
My Lord,

874
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:52,480
I don't know the details.

875
00:39:52,480 --> 00:39:53,350
Hurry up.

876
00:39:54,710 --> 00:39:55,570
Registrar Liu.

877
00:39:58,070 --> 00:39:59,590
I am Liu Cheng,
the registrar of the county government.

878
00:39:59,590 --> 00:40:00,800
Greetings, Divine Constable.

879
00:40:00,800 --> 00:40:03,260
Thank you for your hard work,
Registrar Liu.

880
00:40:05,840 --> 00:40:06,880
Please make sure

881
00:40:07,110 --> 00:40:08,880
to count these valuables carefully,

882
00:40:08,880 --> 00:40:10,000
keep them safe,

883
00:40:10,110 --> 00:40:11,840
and don't let them get damaged.

884
00:40:11,840 --> 00:40:13,920
If they are found to be stolen goods
in the future,

885
00:40:13,920 --> 00:40:16,320
they will be confiscated and turned over
to the state treasury.

886
00:40:16,320 --> 00:40:17,390
But if they are the Gong family's

887
00:40:17,390 --> 00:40:18,320
own belongings,

888
00:40:18,590 --> 00:40:20,250
they must be returned in full.

889
00:40:20,630 --> 00:40:21,630
I understand.

890
00:40:23,710 --> 00:40:24,510
Do you know

891
00:40:25,070 --> 00:40:26,280
where Gong Le is?

892
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:27,190
Right now,

893
00:40:27,320 --> 00:40:28,670
he should be taking care of

894
00:40:28,670 --> 00:40:29,710
Old Madam Gong.

895
00:40:30,190 --> 00:40:31,710
If you want to see him,

896
00:40:32,320 --> 00:40:33,900
I will go and fetch him for you.

897
00:40:33,900 --> 00:40:34,690
No need.

898
00:40:34,880 --> 00:40:35,740
Registrar Liu,

899
00:40:36,030 --> 00:40:38,070
since you were sent by the imperial court

900
00:40:38,070 --> 00:40:39,440
to seal up Gong Mansion,

901
00:40:39,440 --> 00:40:42,000
I believe you know everything in it

902
00:40:42,030 --> 00:40:43,480
like the back of your hand.

903
00:40:43,480 --> 00:40:44,280
Do you know

904
00:40:45,110 --> 00:40:46,710
where Gong Le's room is?

905
00:40:47,280 --> 00:40:48,230
I do.

906
00:40:49,480 --> 00:40:51,030
My Lord, up here

907
00:40:51,030 --> 00:40:52,630
is Gong Le's room.

908
00:40:54,190 --> 00:40:55,230
This is the attic

909
00:40:55,230 --> 00:40:56,360
Meng Rui and I saw in the backyard

910
00:40:56,360 --> 00:40:57,480
that night.

911
00:40:58,190 --> 00:40:59,000
My Lord,

912
00:40:59,070 --> 00:41:00,090
I don't understand.

913
00:41:00,090 --> 00:41:00,840
Why do you have to

914
00:41:00,840 --> 00:41:02,590
come here at night.

915
00:41:03,440 --> 00:41:05,400
That's exactly the reason I am here.

916
00:41:05,400 --> 00:41:06,190
Yes.

917
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:08,800
Young Master Gong

918
00:41:08,920 --> 00:41:11,050
is a well-known scholar in our county.

919
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:13,000
He's well-educated, well-mannered,

920
00:41:13,000 --> 00:41:14,320
and well-read.

921
00:41:15,070 --> 00:41:15,920
He's about to

922
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:17,880
take the imperial exam this year.

923
00:41:18,320 --> 00:41:19,450
Who would have expected

924
00:41:19,450 --> 00:41:21,450
such a thing to happen in his family.

925
00:41:32,710 --> 00:41:34,510
Where can a tavern be found?

926
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:38,200
A shepherd boy points to Xinghua Village
in the distance.

927
00:41:38,590 --> 00:41:40,320
At the east end of Xinghua Alley

928
00:41:40,590 --> 00:41:42,710
is the famous Yulu Pavilion.

929
00:41:46,880 --> 00:41:48,630
Tasting wine and admiring flowers

930
00:41:48,630 --> 00:41:50,000
go perfectly together.

931
00:42:18,400 --> 00:42:20,730
From the Hound Pit
in the west of the county

932
00:42:21,070 --> 00:42:22,670
to Yulu Pavilion in the east,

933
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:26,630
Xinghua Alley is the only route.

934
00:42:27,480 --> 00:42:28,440
Clearly,

935
00:42:28,880 --> 00:42:30,480
Gong Le knew exactly

936
00:42:30,760 --> 00:42:31,550
when Zhe Shan

937
00:42:32,110 --> 00:42:33,510
came and went every time.

938
00:42:42,590 --> 00:42:44,480
Looks like Zhe Shan's body
also wasn't first dumped

939
00:42:44,480 --> 00:42:45,670
in the Yan River.

940
00:42:45,710 --> 00:42:47,670
The methods used
in the two throat-crushing cases

941
00:42:47,670 --> 00:42:49,400
were remarkably similar.

942
00:42:50,480 --> 00:42:51,550
But as for ordering Black Silk Leopard

943
00:42:51,550 --> 00:42:52,510
to attack someone,

944
00:42:52,510 --> 00:42:53,670
it seems only Gong Sihai

945
00:42:53,670 --> 00:42:54,800
could've done that.

946
00:42:55,510 --> 00:42:56,670
A vicious beast like that

947
00:42:56,670 --> 00:42:58,730
usually recognizes only one master.

948
00:42:58,880 --> 00:43:02,210
Could it be that the uncle and nephew
were working together?

949
00:43:02,880 --> 00:43:04,510
To control a beast,

950
00:43:04,800 --> 00:43:05,590
actually,

951
00:43:06,110 --> 00:43:07,480
giving it commands

952
00:43:07,480 --> 00:43:08,710
isn't the only way.

953
00:43:12,280 --> 00:43:13,480
Do you remember that night

954
00:43:13,480 --> 00:43:15,410
when we sneaked into Gong Mansion?

955
00:43:21,920 --> 00:43:22,880
You mean that lantern?

956
00:43:22,880 --> 00:43:24,920
The Gong family is wealthy

957
00:43:25,030 --> 00:43:26,290
and values its facade.

958
00:43:27,190 --> 00:43:28,920
The windproof covers of the lanterns

959
00:43:28,920 --> 00:43:31,050
are painted with intricate patterns.

960
00:43:32,590 --> 00:43:33,710
And the colors

961
00:43:34,400 --> 00:43:36,880
are mostly red and yellow,

962
00:43:36,880 --> 00:43:38,670
which are warm

963
00:43:38,670 --> 00:43:39,600
and auspicious.

964
00:43:39,800 --> 00:43:42,260
There is no funeral
in the mansion right now.

965
00:43:42,480 --> 00:43:43,480
How could they hang

966
00:43:43,480 --> 00:43:45,280
such plain white lanterns?

967
00:43:45,710 --> 00:43:47,320
There is only one possibility.

968
00:43:47,320 --> 00:43:48,520
This is not a lantern,

969
00:43:49,000 --> 00:43:51,130
but a candlestick covered with paper.

970
00:43:52,320 --> 00:43:53,480
This is what

971
00:43:53,710 --> 00:43:55,110
you and I saw that night.

972
00:43:55,400 --> 00:43:57,600
He was sending a signal to the backyard?

973
00:44:01,320 --> 00:44:02,180
Registrar Liu.

974
00:44:03,190 --> 00:44:04,000
My Lords.

975
00:44:04,320 --> 00:44:05,220
Are you two

976
00:44:05,250 --> 00:44:06,650
analyzing the case?

977
00:44:07,030 --> 00:44:09,480
I'm getting more and more confused.

978
00:44:09,800 --> 00:44:10,660
Registrar Liu.

979
00:44:11,590 --> 00:44:12,710
The case will be closed tomorrow.

980
00:44:12,710 --> 00:44:15,030
Please make sure

981
00:44:15,110 --> 00:44:16,710
to record everything in detail.

982
00:44:16,710 --> 00:44:18,920
When this case is reported
to the Divine Constable Bureau,

983
00:44:18,920 --> 00:44:20,840
whether the Chief is satisfied

984
00:44:21,190 --> 00:44:22,950
will all depend on you.

985
00:44:24,710 --> 00:44:25,510
Well...

986
00:44:38,320 --> 00:44:39,880
Divine Constables.

987
00:45:03,280 --> 00:45:04,510
The Divine Constable Tally is here.

988
00:45:04,010 --> 00:45:04,870
[Divine Constable Tally]

989
00:45:05,070 --> 00:45:07,030
Listen carefully, suspects.

990
00:45:07,590 --> 00:45:08,880
If you tell the truth now,

991
00:45:08,880 --> 00:45:10,400
you can still keep some dignity.

992
00:45:10,400 --> 00:45:12,030
But if you lie,

993
00:45:12,630 --> 00:45:14,110
let's see if your heads

994
00:45:14,110 --> 00:45:15,400
are harder than the execution blade

995
00:45:15,400 --> 00:45:16,710
besaide the Shangfang Drum.

996
00:45:16,710 --> 00:45:17,840
From this moment on,

997
00:45:18,400 --> 00:45:20,190
Mingling County is on lockdown.

998
00:45:20,190 --> 00:45:22,710
The ban will be lifted
once the truth is clear.

999
00:45:22,710 --> 00:45:23,570
Sound the drum.

1000
00:45:24,190 --> 00:45:25,000
Start the interrogation!
